{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And they shall take for Me a contribution.</b> This section was said during the forty days that he spent receiving the Torah, and the Holy One, blessed be He, showed him the place where they would make the Mishkan and the Holy of Holies, and within it the Ark, and inside the Ark the Tablets, and there the Shekhinah would rest, and Israel around it, like the angels around the Throne of Glory, with the Shekhinah among them. And thus it is written: ״ושכנתי בתוכם״ — like among the angels. And concerning this it is said: ״אמרתי אלהים אתם ובני עליון כלכם״ — in order that My Shekhinah be among them."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:00.002074725Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}